# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Course_Materials/
Stage_1/Mira's Report/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE on what IS committed, deliberately:
#   Stage_1/Work/*/plots/     figures  - deliverables and evidence of execution
#   Stage_1/Work/*/tables/    CSVs     - the numbers behind every claim
#   Stage_1/Work/*/code/*.ipynb        - WITH outputs, as reproducibility evidence
#   Stage_1/results/                   - final aggregated results
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

